# Look-first

0. No chat context? → `AGENT_BOOTSTRAP.md` + `STATUS.md` (Skill `cold-start`).
1. Read `PRECODE_MAP.md` (`00/`–`12/`).
2. Requirements → `03-requirements/`.
3. Constraints / open questions → `04-constraints/`.
4. Architecture → `07-system-design/` (+ `docs/adr/`).
5. Verification → `08-verification/`.
6. Languages → `07-system-design/options/` and `nests/` (not tip Cargo scaffolds).
7. Research catalog → `research/INDEX.md` (**one** pack).
8. Obey FREEZE in `STATUS.md` — deepen-3 only unless human overrides.
9. Whole words — `GLOSSARY.md`.
